#ntdiff PRIVATE/NTOS/KE/MIPS/EXCEPTN.C PRIVATE/NTOS/KE/ALPHA/EXCEPTN.C
=1 1 13
+    ARM port of KE/MIPS/EXCEPTN.C. A breakpoint exception carries the
+    breakpoint code in its first parameter (ke\trapc.c), as the MIPS break
+    code is. ARMv7 performs unaligned single loads
+    and stores in hardware and the VFPv4 unit implements IEEE arithmetic
+    completely, so there is no alignment or floating point emulation.
=1 13 9
=1 24 4
+
